    <title>RTX 4080 介紹 - 性價比高的顯卡推薦</title>
    <!-- 保持視覺風格與首頁及其他頁面完全一致 -->
    <style>
        body { font-family: "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding: 0; color: #333; background-color: #f4f7f6; }
        header { background: #2c3e50; color: #fff; padding: 2.5rem 1rem; text-align: center; }
        header h1 { margin: 0; font-size: 2.5rem; }
        header p { margin-top: 10px; opacity: 0.9; }
        
        nav { background: #34495e; padding: 12px; text-align: center; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 1000; box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        nav a { color: #fff; margin: 0 18px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; transition: 0.3s; }
        nav a:hover { color: #1abc9c; }
        
        .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 30px auto; padding: 0 20px; min-height: 500px; }
        h2 { border-left: 6px solid #1abc9c; padding-left: 15px; color: #2c3e50; margin-top: 40px; }
        
        .content-box { background: #fff; padding: 30px; border-radius: 10px; box-shadow: 0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05); border: 1px solid #ddd; }
        
        /* 圖片框框：確保 4080 的圖片能縮放並完整顯示在框框內 */
        .gpu-image-container {
            width: 100%;
            max-width: 600px;
            height: 350px;
            margin: 25px auto;
            background: #eee;
            border-radius: 8px;
            overflow: hidden;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
        }

        .gpu-image-container img {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            object-fit: contain; /* 讓圖片完整縮放且不變形 */
            background-color: #fff;
        }

        .back-btn { display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px; padding: 10px 20px; background-color: #2980b9; color: white; text-decoration: none; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold; }
        .back-btn:hover { background-color: #3498db; }
        
        footer { background: #2c3e50; color: #fff; text-align: center; padding: 1.5rem; margin-top: 60px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<header>
    <h1>性價比高的顯卡推薦</h1>
    <p>正在查看：RTX 4080 詳細資訊</p>
</header>

<nav>
